      "type": "background",
      "headline": "A band formed in 1995 that didn't record until 2001",
      "snippet": "Johan Duncanson started The Radio Dept. in 1995, but the band didn't begin recording until 2001. That same year they signed to Labrador Records and have stayed with the label ever since. The lineup shifted over time before settling as a trio: Duncanson, Martin Carlberg and keyboardist Daniel Tjäder.",
