      "snippet": "After a four-year gap following Pet Grief, the band released Clinging to a Scheme in 2010. It was far better received than its predecessor. It became their first album to chart in the USA, reaching no. 20 on Billboard's Heatseekers chart. It also appeared on many end-of-year lists.",
